## 7.6 API and Gateway Security

Kong (ADR-003) menegakkan kontrol keamanan terpusat (rincian fungsi pada BAB 5.9):

| Kontrol                     | Realisasi                                                     | Ancaman Ditangani     |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Authentication enforcement  | Validasi OAuth2/OIDC/JWT                                       | Spoofing              |
| Rate limiting & throttling  | Plugin per konsumen/klien (INT-016)                           | DoS/abuse             |
| Input validation            | Validasi skema request pada gateway & layanan                 | Injection/Tampering   |
| TLS termination             | Terminasi TLS + re-enkripsi ke *upstream*                     | Info disclosure       |
| IP restriction / WAF        | Pembatasan sumber & aturan WAF untuk endpoint sensitif        | DoS/intrusion         |
| OWASP API Security Top 10   | Pedoman desain endpoint & review keamanan                    | Beragam               |

