## 7.10 Security in the SDLC

Keamanan diintegrasikan ke pipeline (rincian pada BAB 10):

| Tahap        | Kontrol Keamanan                                              | Referensi        |
| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Code         | *Secure coding standard*, *secret scanning*                   | NFR-016          |
| Build/Test   | **SAST**, *dependency/CVE scan* (SCA)                        | NFR-016, NFR-017 |
| Pre-deploy   | *Container image scan*, *image signing*                      | NFR-016          |
| Runtime      | **DAST**, *penetration testing* berkala, *vulnerability scan* | NFR-017          |

Penetration testing menyeluruh minimum 1×/tahun; vulnerability scanning otomatis minimum 1×/bulan (NFR-017).

